{"id":"H3122","lemma":"יוֹנָדָב","transliteration":"yonadav","sayIt":"yo-na-DAV","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Jonadab","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2Sa.13.3;\nson of: Shimeah (H8093); also called Jonathan at 2Sa.21.21; 1x27.32;\n§ Jonadab or Jehonadab = \"Jehovah is willing\"\n1) a son of Rechab, chief of the Rechabites, in the time of Jehu and Ahab\n2) a nephew of David","glosses":["jonadab","so jonadab"],"count":6,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jonadab","kjv":"was Jonadab"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"But Jonadab","kjv":"And Jonadab"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"So Jonadab","kjv":"And Jonadab"}},{"chapterId":"jer-35","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jonadab","kjv":"for Jonadab"}},{"chapterId":"jer-35","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jonadab","kjv":"according to all that Jonadab"}},{"chapterId":"jer-35","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jonadab","kjv":"Jonadab"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"2 Samuel 13:3","note":"But Amnon had a friend, whose name was Jonadab, the son of Shimeah, David’s brother; and Jonadab was a very subtle man.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Jeremiah 35:6","note":"But they said, “We will drink no wine; for Jonadab the son of Rechab, our father, commanded us, saying, ‘You shall drink no wine, neither you, nor your sons…","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H3082","lemma":"יְהוֹנָדָב","transliteration":"yehonadav","gloss":"Jonadab"},{"id":"H8093","lemma":"שִׁמְעָה","transliteration":"shimah","gloss":"Shimeah"},{"id":"H3083","lemma":"יְהוֹנָתָן","transliteration":"yehonatan","gloss":"Jonathan"},{"id":"H7394","lemma":"רֵכָב","transliteration":"rekhav","gloss":"Rechab"},{"id":"H8048","lemma":"שַׁמָּה","transliteration":"shammah","gloss":"Shammah"},{"id":"H8092","lemma":"שִׁמְעָא","transliteration":"shimah, shima","gloss":"Shimea"},{"id":"H8096","lemma":"שִׁמְעִי","transliteration":"shimi","gloss":"Shimei"}],"senses":[{"id":"H3122H","gloss":"Jonadab","relation":"H3122H = a Name of"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}